    "Japanese Embassy"
   ],
   "start_page": 1,
   "summary": "Embassy Rome requests Japanese Foreign Office confirmation of powers of attorney granted to Giulio Dante for private effects.",
   "title": "Telegram 3228 from Rome to Secretary of State on Dante Power of Attorney",
   "to": "Secretary of State"
  },
  {
   "about": "Advises OCD that Embassy Rome can microfilm requested archive items and notes imminent redeployment of Nisei personnel.",
